@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
title Locale editions | Arabic release, English-ready structure
class ContentRevision {
  revisionId
  schemaVersion
  canonicalStepIds
  canonicalChoiceIds
}
class LocaleEdition {
  editionId
  locale: ar or en
  editionVersion
  reviewState
}
class LocalizedField {
  contentKey
  fieldKey
  localizedValue
}
class LocalizedMedia {
  contentKey
  assetId
  captionAssetId
  accessibilityText
}
class CatalogLabel {
  entityId
  locale
  labelKey
  publishedValue
}
class LearningAttempt {
  revisionId
  sessionEditionId
  completedStepIds
}
ContentRevision "1" *-- "1..*" LocaleEdition
LocaleEdition "1" *-- "1..*" LocalizedField
LocaleEdition "1" *-- "0..*" LocalizedMedia
LearningAttempt --> ContentRevision : progress identity
LearningAttempt --> LocaleEdition : presentation selection
CatalogLabel ..> ContentRevision : catalog references
note bottom of LocaleEdition
Arabic required at launch; English may be absent.
Published editions are immutable and reviewed.
Translation preserves graph and completion IDs.
Changed learning logic needs a new canonical revision.
end note
@enduml
